---
type Props = {
  latestDailyUrl?: string;
};

const { latestDailyUrl = "/docs/" } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="cyber-hero executive-hero">
  <div class="cyber-hero__copy executive-hero__copy">
    <p class="cyber-eyebrow">Front Page / AI Intelligence</p>
    <h1>给 AI 时代决策者的每日头版</h1>
    <p class="cyber-hero__lede">
      焦糖星球把产品、研究、开源、资本与工程信号重新编排成一份可读、可查、可行动的中文情报报。
    </p>
    <div class="cyber-hero__actions">
      <a class="cp-btn" href={latestDailyUrl}>打开今日头版</a>
      <a class="cp-btn cp-btn--ghost" href="/blog/?category=weekly">阅读本周社论</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="system-card executive-brief" aria-label="今日情报面板">
    <div class="system-card__top">
      <div>
        <span>Morning Edition</span>
        <strong>Editor's Desk</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="system-card__status">
        <i></i>
        Filed
      </div>
    </div>
    <img class="system-card__visual" src="/og/site.png" alt="" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    <div class="executive-brief__rows">
      <p><span>版面</span><strong>日报 / 周报 / 长文</strong></p>
      <p><span>取材</span><strong>公开信源与项目动态</strong></p>
      <p><span>编辑</span><strong>重写标题、摘要与判断</strong></p>
    </div>
    <p class="system-card__note">每条信号保留来源链路，进入编辑管线后按重要性、影响范围和工程价值重新排序。</p>
  </aside>
</section>
